{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/financial-arithmetic/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/financial-arithmetic.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Financial Arithmetic | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -arrow-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>Back to Foundations</a></nav>\n    \n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-6 border-b pb-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Financial Arithmetic</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Master simple and compound interest, discounts, depreciation, and basic annuities - essential skills for WAEC success and real-world financial literacy.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n        <ul class=\"text-sm text-blue-700 space-y-1\">\n          <li>• Calculate simple interest using the formula I = PRT</li>\n          <li>• Calculate compound interest and final amounts</li>\n          <li>• Apply discount and depreciation calculations</li>\n          <li>• Solve problems involving hire purchase and amortization</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: Simple Interest -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">1</span>\n          Simple Interest\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Simple interest is calculated only on the original principal amount. It's straightforward and commonly used for short-term loans.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-lg font-bold text-gray-800\">Simple Interest Formula</p>\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-xl text-green-600 mt-2\">I = P × R × T</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\">Where: I = Interest, P = Principal, R = Rate (as decimal), T = Time (years)</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 1 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-green-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example 1: Calculating Simple Interest</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate the simple interest on ₦8,000 invested at 5% per annum for 3 years.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify the values</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside ml-4 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>Principal (P) = ₦8,000</li>\n                  <li>Rate (R) = 5% = 0.05 (convert to decimal)</li>\n                  <li>Time (T) = 3 years</li>\n                </ul>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply the formula</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  I = P × R × T<br>\n                  I = 8,000 × 0.05 × 3<br>\n                  I = ₦1,200\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The simple interest is ₦1,200</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 2 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-green-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example 2: Finding the Principal</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: What sum of money invested at 4% per annum will yield ₦600 interest in 2½ years?</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify the values</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside ml-4 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>Interest (I) = ₦600</li>\n                  <li>Rate (R) = 4% = 0.04</li>\n                  <li>Time (T) = 2.5 years</li>\n                </ul>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Rearrange the formula to find P</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  P = I ÷ (R × T)<br>\n                  P = 600 ÷ (0.04 × 2.5)<br>\n                  P = 600 ÷ 0.1<br>\n                  P = ₦6,000\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The principal is ₦6,000</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Compound Interest -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">2</span>\n          Compound Interest\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Compound interest is calculated on the principal plus any accumulated interest. This is how most bank accounts and investments work.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-lg font-bold text-gray-800\">Compound Interest Formula</p>\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-xl text-blue-600 mt-2\">A = P(1 + R)ⁿ</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\">Where: A = Final Amount, P = Principal, R = Rate (as decimal), n = Number of periods</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 mb-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb mr-2\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span>Key Difference</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-yellow-700\">Simple Interest = Interest on principal only | Compound Interest = Interest on principal + accumulated interest. This is why compound interest grows faster over time!</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Compound Interest Calculation</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Find the compound interest on ₦5,000 invested at 6% per annum for 3 years.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify the values</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside ml-4 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>Principal (P) = ₦5,000</li>\n                  <li>Rate (R) = 6% = 0.06</li>\n                  <li>Number of years (n) = 3</li>\n                </ul>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply the formula</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  A = P(1 + R)ⁿ<br>\n                  A = 5,000 × (1 + 0.06)³<br>\n                  A = 5,000 × (1.06)³<br>\n                  A = 5,000 × 1.191016<br>\n                  A = ₦5,955.08\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Calculate the interest</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  Interest = A - P = ₦5,955.08 - ₦5,000 = ₦955.08\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The compound interest is ₦955.08 (compare with simple interest: ₦900)</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Discount and Depreciation -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">3</span>\n          Discount and Depreciation\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -tags mr-2\" data-mi=\"style\">style</span>Discount</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">A reduction in the original price of an item.</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">Discount = Original Price × Discount Rate</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded mt-2\">Sale Price = Original Price - Discount</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-orange-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -chart-line mr-2\" data-mi=\"show_chart\">show_chart</span>Depreciation</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">A decrease in the value of an asset over time.</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">Depreciated Value = Original Value × (1 - rate)ⁿ</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-purple-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Depreciation</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: A car bought for ₦2,000,000 depreciates at 15% per annum. Find its value after 4 years.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Identify the values</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside ml-4 space-y-1\">\n                  <li>Original Value = ₦2,000,000</li>\n                  <li>Depreciation Rate = 15% = 0.15</li>\n                  <li>Time (n) = 4 years</li>\n                </ul>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply the depreciation formula</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                  Value = 2,000,000 × (1 - 0.15)⁴<br>\n                  Value = 2,000,000 × (0.85)⁴<br>\n                  Value = 2,000,000 × 0.5220<br>\n                  Value = ₦1,044,000\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The car's value after 4 years is ₦1,044,000</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Hire Purchase -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-red-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">4</span>\n          Hire Purchase\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Hire purchase allows you to buy items by paying a deposit followed by installments. The total paid is usually more than the cash price.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-center\">Total Hire Purchase Price = Deposit + (Monthly Installments × Number of Months)</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-red-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Hire Purchase</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: A television has a cash price of ₦120,000. It can also be bought on hire purchase by paying 20% deposit and 12 monthly installments of ₦10,000. Calculate the extra amount paid on hire purchase.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Calculate the deposit</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">Deposit = 20% × 120,000 = ₦24,000</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Calculate total installments</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">Total Installments = 12 × 10,000 = ₦120,000</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Calculate total hire purchase price</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">HP Price = 24,000 + 120,000 = ₦144,000</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Calculate extra amount</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">Extra = 144,000 - 120,000 = ₦24,000</div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The extra amount paid is ₦24,000 (which is 20% of the cash price)</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Real World Applications -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -globe text-teal-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"public\">public</span>\n          Real-World Applications\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-teal-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -university mr-2\" data-mi=\"account_balance\">account_balance</span>Banking</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Banks use compound interest for savings accounts and loans. Understanding this helps you compare different financial products.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-indigo-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-indigo-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -store mr-2\" data-mi=\"store\">store</span>Shopping</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Understanding discounts helps you calculate sale prices and compare \"buy now, pay later\" options.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Practice Problems -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt text-orange-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n          Practice Problems\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">1. Find the simple interest on ₦15,000 at 8% per annum for 2½ years.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice1\" placeholder=\"Enter your answer (₦)\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">2. Calculate the amount after 3 years when ₦10,000 is invested at 5% compound interest annually.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice2\" placeholder=\"Enter amount (₦)\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">3. A laptop costs ₦180,000 cash. On hire purchase, a 25% deposit is required plus 6 monthly payments of ₦26,000. How much extra is paid?</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice3\" placeholder=\"Enter extra amount (₦)\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Video Resource -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -youtube text-red-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"smart_display\">smart_display</span>\n          Video Resources\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"aspect-video w-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-lg\">\n          <iframe class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dnBPHA9VnOk\" title=\"Simple and Compound Interest\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\n          </iframe>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Summary -->\n      <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 to-teal-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -clipboard-list mr-2\" data-mi=\"fact_check\">fact_check</span>Key Formulas Summary</h3>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-green-700\">Simple Interest</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono\">I = P × R × T</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700\">Compound Interest</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono\">A = P(1 + R)ⁿ</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-purple-700\">Discount</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono\">Discount = Original Price × Rate</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-white/70 p-3 rounded\">\n            <p class=\"font-semibold text-red-700\">Depreciation</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono\">Value = P × (1 - rate)ⁿ</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} .accordion-content{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.3s ease-out;}.accordion-content.open{max-height:2000px;}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}